1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,338
One person. Twelve AI agents.

2
00:00:02,338 --> 00:00:08,959
By Friday, two of them share a branch, nobody has reviewed anything, and everything says done.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,414
Done, with no pull request, no test run, and no second pair of eyes.

4
00:00:13,414 --> 00:00:16,059
That isn't done. That's unknown.

5
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,927
Agent Company fixes the team, not the model.

6
00:00:18,927 --> 00:00:25,975
You stay the owner. Each agent gets one job, written orders, an independent reviewer and an evidence trail.

7
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,332
You learn it by playing. In Guild mode, you forge a character.

8
00:00:30,332 --> 00:00:33,398
Its class is its job. Its origin is its tool:

9
00:00:33,398 --> 00:00:36,131
Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI.

10
00:00:36,367 --> 00:00:38,742
Then you fit the OpenProof harness:

11
00:00:38,742 --> 00:00:40,845
six pieces, each a real limit.

12
00:00:40,845 --> 00:00:43,288
Own worktree. Deny rules. No merge.

13
00:00:43,288 --> 00:00:45,935
Tool allowlist. Constructed data only.

14
00:00:45,935 --> 00:00:47,621
Evidence trail.

15
00:00:47,867 --> 00:00:49,500
Drag your team onto the map.

16
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,367
A builder in a reviewer's slot?

17
00:00:51,367 --> 00:00:56,518
Refused. When the ring turns green, deploy writes real orders into your repo.

18
00:00:56,767 --> 00:00:59,303
The rule that matters: no proof, no XP.

19
00:00:59,303 --> 00:01:02,621
A pull request, the tests, an independent verdict.

20
00:01:02,621 --> 00:01:05,353
An OpenProof record seals it for full XP.

21
00:01:05,353 --> 00:01:07,189
Without one, half.

22
00:01:07,433 --> 00:01:10,326
Levels unlock talents and more quests at once.

23
00:01:10,326 --> 00:01:17,151
Three vows never change: never merge, never a protected branch, never real data to a hosted model.

24
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:22,499
Play a fantasy realm, a neon city, sky islands or a star fleet, or build your own.

25
00:01:22,499 --> 00:01:25,027
On a laptop, or on your phone.

26
00:01:25,267 --> 00:01:27,520
Agent Company. Free and open source.

27
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:30,249
Run your agents like a good team.
